        Cognitive Load-Aware <span class="search-hit mathjax">Inference</span>: A Neuro-Symbolic Framework for Optimizing the Token Economy of Large <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span>
      
