    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        VQ-VLA: Improving Vision-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span>-Action <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span> via Scaling Vector-Quantized Action Tokenizers
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wang%2C+Y">Yating Wang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhu%2C+H">Haoyi Zhu</a>, 
      
